    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SUNGAI LEMBING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sungai Lembing is a historical tin-mining town near Bandar Indera Mahkota."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0382-c71143f5ded1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EAST COAST EXPRESSWAY (LPT)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"East Coast Expressway (LPT) is a major highway used by road users from Kuantan to Bandar Indera Mahkota."&lt;SEP&gt;"East Coast Expressway (LPT) is a major highway used by road users from Sydney to Bandar Indera Mahkota."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0382-c71143f5ded1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SULTAN HAJI AHMAD SHAH AIRPORT&quot;">
